    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i just feel like the most loving thing i could do is actually stop being a problem for them. like, every day i wakeup is just another day they have to sacrifice their own lives to take care of mine. it feels so selfish to keep going when i know they'd be so much lighter without me.",
